ress stats show \"Total: 0\", \"Completed: 0\", \"In Progress: 0\", \"Remaining: 0\". The progress bar is empty (0%). The issue list shows an empty state message (e.g., \"No issues in this cycle\"). The burndown chart shows no data.\n1534-\n1535:### CreateCycle\n1536-\n1537-#### Test: \"New Cycle\" button is visible on the cycles page\n1538-- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, navigates to `/team/eng-1/cycles`.\n--\n1541-#### Test: Clicking \"New Cycle\" opens create cycle modal with correct fields\n1542-- **Initial state**: User is on `/team/eng-1/cycles`.\n1543-- **Action**: User clicks the \"New Cycle\" button.\n1544:- **Expected**: A modal dialog opens with: a \"Name\" text input field (required), a \"Start date\" date picker, an \"End date\" date picker, a \"Create\" button, and a \"Cancel\" button. The modal has a title like \"New Cycle\" or \"Create Cycle\".\n1545-\n1546-#### Test: Successfully creating a cycle with all fields filled\n1547-- **Initial state**: Create cycle modal is open. Team has no active cycle.","numLines":23}}
